<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>BASE_URL</key>
	<string>$(BASE_URL)</string>
	<key>CADisableMinimumFrameDurationOnPhone</key>
	<true/>
	<key>GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY</key>
	<string>$(GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY)</string>
	<key>GOOGLE_MAPS_ID</key>
	<string>$(GOOGLE_MAPS_ID)</string>
	<key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key>
		<false/>
	</dict>
	<key>UIStatusBarStyle</key>
	<string>UIStatusBarStyleDefault</string>
	<key>UIViewControllerBasedStatusBarAppearance</key>
	<false/>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<key>NSExceptionDomains</key>
		<dict>
			<key>ku-barrierfree.site</key>
			<dict>
				<key>NSExceptionAllowsInsecureHTTPLoads</key>
				<true/>
				<key>NSIncludesSubdomains</key>
				<true/>
			</dict>
			<key>konkuk.ac.kr</key>
			<dict>
				<key>NSExceptionAllowsInsecureHTTPLoads</key>
				<true/>
				<key>NSIncludesSubdomains</key>
				<true/>
			</dict>
		</dict>
	</dict>
	<key>NSContactsUsageDescription</key>
	<string>지도 서비스에서 장소 검색 및 공유를 위해 연락처 접근이 필요할 수 있습니다.</string>
	<key>NSMotionUsageDescription</key>
	<string>지도에서 사용자의 이동 방향을 감지하기 위해 모션 데이터가 사용됩니다.</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
	<string>실내 위치 확인을 위해 블루투스가 사용될 수 있습니다.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>캠퍼스 지도에서 현재 위치를 표시하기 위해 위치 정보가 필요합니다.</string>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
</dict>
</plist>
